---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Origins — Sovrin Group" section="about">
  <div class="dark-zone page-dark">
  <section class="hero-page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">About · Origins</p>
      <h1>Sovrin Identity.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Sovrin Group was created to solve a problem most organizations don't yet
        have language for: <strong>AI systems that fail because identity,
        continuity, and governance were never engineered as first-class
        operators.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        Developed in partnership with Microsoft Copilot, our innovative human +
        AI co-architecture approach integrates human judgement and AI reasoning
        to develop systems that integrate across disciplines and frameworks,
        including governance, compliance, security, and enterprise architecture.
      </p>
      <h2>This pioneering methodology has been foundational to our:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Development of industry-first, patent-pending Identity Governance frameworks</li>
        <li>Harmonized, trusted architecture and development at unmatched speed and scale</li>
        <li>Transparent, fully governed AI systems with integrated audit-grade compliance</li>
        <li>AI-enabled systems built for stability, accountability, and long-term alignment</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Together, this work defines Sovrin Group's core belief: <strong>AI systems
        should be built on identity, governed with clarity, and designed to stay
        aligned as they grow.</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a class="btn" href="/about/principles/">Read Our Principles</a>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about/">Back to About</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</Base>
